{
    "word": "rhino",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "062e83cb-792f-3204-9c88-33fbc49546bf",
                "word": "rhino",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "50abb17b-0e2d-3fad-abb6-a53edbb3b7e1",
                        "entry_id": "062e83cb-792f-3204-9c88-33fbc49546bf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Money."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "archaic",
                            "slang",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1c017ba7-7d90-4807-8b94-542e67a1a488",
                                "sense_id": "50abb17b-0e2d-3fad-abb6-a53edbb3b7e1",
                                "text": "When so be as a man has no money, why then, a savin and exceptin your onnur's reverence, a's but a poor dog. But when so be as a man as got the rhino, why then a may begin to hold up his head."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "99cf031d-474e-4629-b1f4-74b8cb247739",
                                "sense_id": "50abb17b-0e2d-3fad-abb6-a53edbb3b7e1",
                                "text": "There I fell in with Betsy, and as she proved a regular out and outer, I spliced her, and a famous wedding we had of it, as long as the rhino lasted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "09c7b932-182a-4e0f-bb96-8c4f844d9fc6",
                                "sense_id": "50abb17b-0e2d-3fad-abb6-a53edbb3b7e1",
                                "text": "—Here you are, says Alf, chucking out the rhino. Talking about hanging, I'll show you something you never saw"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "dc7f7aa7-b2bd-3f4e-9503-0e0e03c57d9c",
                "word": "rhino",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "b48741af-ebfc-4a88-9213-c8e977a73b9f",
                        "entry_id": "dc7f7aa7-b2bd-3f4e-9503-0e0e03c57d9c",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rhinos"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b6cc57d3-1dbe-327d-b63f-a1fe37a667a0",
                        "entry_id": "dc7f7aa7-b2bd-3f4e-9503-0e0e03c57d9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A rhinoceros."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7c7bd08-26f8-4aa0-b80a-07989e702614",
                                "sense_id": "b6cc57d3-1dbe-327d-b63f-a1fe37a667a0",
                                "text": "‘We were getting a grand shot of a charging rhino when the cameraman got scared and bolted. The fathead!’"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38133efb-2b50-44c7-a183-6faeadc31fd2",
                                "sense_id": "b6cc57d3-1dbe-327d-b63f-a1fe37a667a0",
                                "text": "This cutting from an East African newspaper caught our eye last month: \"The up mail train from Mombasa was held up for an hour at Kibwezi by an angry rhino on Monday night.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "aa820700-04c7-4521-8f30-5818266c0fb9",
                        "source_entry_id": "dc7f7aa7-b2bd-3f4e-9503-0e0e03c57d9c",
                        "source_sense_id": "b6cc57d3-1dbe-327d-b63f-a1fe37a667a0",
                        "source_sense_description": "short form of rhinoceros",
                        "target_lang_word": "rhino",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "rhino",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "143bf0d6-021c-3e3c-93e9-5b037d5181b4",
                                        "entry_id": "e4de89ee-5669-3123-b1a8-619fe01a6eef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rhinopharyngite, rhume."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b3bf9b5-62d2-40c6-8ebb-7ecd4d067ba8",
                                                "sense_id": "143bf0d6-021c-3e3c-93e9-5b037d5181b4",
                                                "text": "« Tant qu’on reste dans les rhinos, les gastros, les angines, les brochiolites, la varicelle, le pied-main-bouche, etc., il ne faut pas s’inquiéter. Par contre, si c’est plus intense que la normale, il faut peut-être aller voir du côté de l’immunité », conseille Brigitte Virey, présidente du Syndicat national des pédiatres français."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "rhino",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e73530a1-eeea-3e6a-96ce-e80b9a32f8b8",
                                        "entry_id": "9a452a06-d903-3228-8385-2948d1bb697a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Abréviation de rhinocéros."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92799dc4-8935-40d0-80c9-4a771d26fc1d",
                                                "sense_id": "e73530a1-eeea-3e6a-96ce-e80b9a32f8b8",
                                                "text": "On chasse le rhino en Afrique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0fe676d-a005-45b3-be58-0b242e172db3",
                                                "sense_id": "e73530a1-eeea-3e6a-96ce-e80b9a32f8b8",
                                                "text": "L’éléphant a eu le dessus – comme toujours, dit John. Il a fini par renverser le rhino d’un coup d’épaule – quel coup et quelle épaule ! – et par le piétiner."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            }
        ],
